00:49:39.059 --> 00:49:40.255
I think so. Yeah.

00:49:40.255 --> 00:49:41.088
Yeah.

00:49:41.088 --> 00:49:41.921
Yeah.

00:49:41.921 --> 00:49:42.754
I mean, just super.

00:49:42.754 --> 00:49:44.655
Mission accomplished on that front.

00:49:44.655 --> 00:49:46.921
Maybe eight people, it was, it was fun.

00:49:46.921 --> 00:49:49.951
There was, someone was attacked
by a bat. Is that right?

